From 2c5865add32b089f5c74d350f7affa75eec67c10 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 3 Jul 2026 01:09:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] test(uc-compat): authenticated OpenFGA e2e with offline
 OIDC stub

Add an offline OIDC stub (discovery, JWKS, client-credentials tokens)
so MODE=openfga runs with real Bearer tokens and no external IdP:
bootstrap-as-admin, owner action sets, 404 existence-masking before
grants, assignments-API grants, 200-read/403-write after select-only
grant, function and model spot checks. DuckDB engine test now runs
offline via the bundled httpfs extension wheel.
